v1.0.55 build 65: title bar — unified font scale (Apple HIG)

Title "Ukuran" rendered in AppTypography.navTitle (17pt, w600) while
button labels rendered at 15pt. Result: title visually heavier than
buttons, breaking iOS sheet convention where all bar elements share
the same 17pt scale.

Fix:
- Title: 17pt, w500 (medium) — clearly the title, not overpowering
- Button labels: 17pt, w400 / w600 — same scale as title

Also dropped the now-unused `app_typography` import.